<title>UK: Dresdner sets $250 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner sets $250 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and PaineWebber.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    04.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.725    PAY DATE    04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.5375   SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURIES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
